      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nYou want to add a Slot to a weapon?\nI categorize weapons by their difficulty in adding a Slot, C Class being easiest and S Class the most difficult.\nWhich class would you like to try?",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n您想為武器新增插槽？\n我會根據新增插槽的難度對武器進行分類，C級最容易，S級最難。\n您想嘗試哪個等級？"
    },
