    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nGreat, it seems to be successful.\nIt looks pretty well done. Congratulations!",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n太好了，看來成功了。\n做得還不錯，恭喜您！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nSee you again, buddy!",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n下次見，朋友！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nWah! ...I am so sorry, it failed.\nHowever, I am completely innocent.\nThis is your luck, and it is destined by god, okay?\nDon't be so disappointed, and try next time.",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n哇！...真抱歉，失敗了。\n不過，這可不能怪我。\n這得看您的運氣，成敗都是上天註定的，明白嗎？\n別太失望，下次再試吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nI wish you good luck next time!",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n祝您下次好運！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nI'd like to go ahead with this Slot Addition attempt, but you're missing a few things.\nYou sure that you have the equipment, required materials and the zeny?",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n我倒是想幫您開槽，可您還缺點東西。\n您確定裝備、所需材料和Zeny都帶齊了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nNeed some time to think about it, huh?\nAlright, I can understand.\nJust remember that life's no fun if you're always playing it safe~",
      "translation" : "[賽亞佈雷姆]\n還需要時間考慮一下，是嗎？\n好，我能理解。\n不過，凡事都求穩，人生可就沒什麼樂趣了~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]\nI'm considering becoming a Slotting Engineer.\nIt's a new field where you can add Slots to equipment, and it'd be cool if I can work in such a lucrative career.",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]\n我正在考慮成為一名開槽工程師。\n這是個給裝備新增插槽的新行當，要是能幹上這麼賺錢的工作，那該多好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]\nThere's a huge element of luck involved in successfully adding Slots from what I can understand.\nYou fail sometimes, but if you're super lucky, you can add two Slots.\nCrazy. Huh?",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]\n據我瞭解，開槽能不能成功，很大程度上得看運氣。\n有時候會失敗，但要是運氣特別好，還能加出兩個插槽。\n厲害吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]\nBut don't get too excited.\nOnly certain equipment can handle the addition of two extra Slots.\nThere's so much more I have to learn before I can even be an apprentice...",
      "translation" : "[年輕男子]\n不過，先別高興得太早。\n只有特定裝備才能增加兩個插槽。\n想當個學徒，我都還有好多東西要學..."
    }
